+# Grey Box
+
+The studio's own Unity template, brought back as if somebody else had made it: a Unity 6 URP
+project with a ground, four walls, a player capsule on a CharacterController with Input System
+actions, an overview camera, an eye camera and the studio's probes — and none of the studio's
+pages, so that opening it proves what the Open Game sheet says about a Unity project and exactly
+which files adoption writes into it. It carries the Pipeline package in its manifest and the
+bridge package's stub, so its facts line reads "Unity 6000.0.50f1 · URP · Input System" and the
+once-asked write is not asked.
